(149: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%20Reviewed%20private%20CST%20transport%20runner%0A%0AThis%20experimental%20runner%20compiles%20the%20frozen%20Rust%20and%20Agda%20build-helper%20snapshot%0Afrom3780504667f4abe167a270263453e54be2b1cc43%2C%20with%20only%20the%20generated%20parent%2C%0Achild%20and%20isolated%20native%20probe%20overlaid.%20Production%20remains%20unchanged.%20Its%0Anative%20compilation%20and%20assertions%20are%20unverified%20until%20CI%20executes%20them.%0A%0AThe%20default%20authenticates%20inputs%20only.%20Native%20execution%20requires%20explicit%0A--native%2C%20META_LANGUAGE_B95_NATIVE_OUTCOME%3D1%2C%20CI%3Dtrue%2C%20GITHUB_ACTIONS%3Dtrue%2C%0ALinux%2C%20the%20actual%20workspace%20and%20an%20external%20owned%20RUNNER_TEMP.%20Local%20compilation%0Ais%20forbidden.%20All%20commands%20use%20argument%20arrays%20and%20bounded%20owned%20process%20groups.%0A%0AFrozen%20Git%20blob%20identities%20and%20SHA256%20hashes%20determine%20every%20copied%20source%20byte.%0ACurrent%20working-input%20hashes%20are%20recorded%20separately%20and%20compared%20again%20after%0Aexecution.%20This%20permits%20publication%20of%20new%20naming%20metadata%20without%20silently%0Areplacing%20the%20compiled%20baseline.%20The%20generator%20predecessor%20pins%20still%20authenticate%0Aits%20current%20type%2Fsource%20owners%3B%20dependency%20declarations%20and%20lockfiles%20stay%20exact%0Afor%20the%20existing%20shared%20JavaScript%20dependency%20installation.%20This%20is%20baseline%0Acandidate%20evidence%2C%20never%20current%20production%2Fdefault-CST%20evidence.%0A%0AThe%20runner%20retains%20a%20Links%20ownership%20marker%2C%20generated%20oracle%2C%20process%20logs%2C%20tool%0Aversions%2C%20exact%20source%20inventories%20and%20native%20report.%20It%20generates%20the%20JavaScript%0Aoracle%20once%20outside%20the%20checkout%2C%20then%20retains%20identical%20bytes%20in%20artifacts.%0ACargo%20is%20offline%2C%20locked%2C%20one%20job%2C%20compile-only%20with%20a15minute%20bound%3B%20actual%0Aartifact%20execution%20has%20a%20separate60second%20bound.%20No%20source%20tests%2C%20production%0Amutator%2C%20dependency%20changes%2C%20installs%2C%20fetches%2C%20cleanup%20or%20ledger%20records%20are%20added.%0A%0AThe%20finite%20candidate%20refuses%20depth%20settings%20above256%20and%20compares%20complete%0Aordered%20values%20and%20binary64%20bits.%20Native%2FJavaScript%20container%20identity%2C%20public%0Adefault%20projection%2C%20arbitrary-depth%20support%20and%20whole-language%20coverage%20remain%0Aopen.%20Existing%20decoder%20budgets%20and%20numeric%20semantics%20remain%20unchanged.%0A%0AOriginal%20authored%20packets%20remain%20intact%20in%20the%20sibling%20unreviewed%20directory.%0ARoot%20retains%20separate%20source-only%2C%20JavaScript-oracle%20and%20injected-process%20logs%3B%0Anone%20establishes%20native%20compilation%20or%20native%20behavior.%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
